workspace-shared-token.json.*

# Scratch dumps of a local investigation run (grep output, build logs, one-off
# command output). They are read once and thrown away — never part of the app.
/_tmp_*
/_*.txt
/_*.json
/_replica_*.pdb
**/_ls_*.txt

